  775:       // expressible against these two members: both deployed blocks declare `verify_jwt = true`, so
  776:       // the gateway answers a missing token and a revoked one alike, and a member that could be
  777:       // called with no session at all would be describing a request the gateway never forwards. So
  778:       // what this arm proves is that a caller whose session has ended reads neither surface â€” and at
  779:       // this tier nothing distinguishes that refusal from the one a caller with no token receives.
