  16:  * developer is a fact carried BY the project row, so the target read is both the last read and one of
  17:  * the decision's inputs â€” which is consistent rather than an exception. The constraint is that
  18:  * NOTHING is read after the target, so a fault answers the same 502 for a real foreign project and
